  "_id": "index-helaman-2-sons-of",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Helaman convinces Lamanites not to break oath, never to shed blood, Alma 53:14–15. sons had not entered covenant, assemble, call themselves Nephites, Alma 53:16. the 2,000 enter covenant to protect liberty, Alma 53:17–18. ask Helaman to be their leader, Alma 53:19. are courageous, obedient to commandments, Alma 53:20–21 (56:46–47). march to support of people in borders, Alma 53:22 (56:57). Helaman tells Moroni1 about sons of Ammonites, Alma 56:3. Helaman calls them his sons, Alma 56:10. have greatest courage among Nephites, Alma 56:45. were taught not to doubt by their mothers, Alma 56:47–48. defeat Lamanites, Alma 56:52–54. none slain, Alma 56:55–56. Helaman joined by 60 additional sons of Ammonites, Alma 57:6. fight valiantly, Alma 57:19–21. are selected to convey prisoners, Alma 57:22. two hundred wounded, none perish, Alma 57:24–25 (58:39). are preserved by faith, Alma 57:26. in city of Manti with Helaman, Alma 58:39.",
